[?2004l[?2004h> # Investigation Progress & Working Checklist
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Overview
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Target Host**: `postgres-prod-01` (`10.10.31.1` as per `/disk/etc/hosts:2`)
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Incident**: Post-compromise DFIR investigation following PostgreSQL COPY ... TO PROGRAM execution, DNS tunneling exfiltration, cron and systemd persistence, and file timestomping.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **Analysis Date**: 2026-08-23
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> ## Timeline of Key Incident Events
