[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 00:53:23 UTC**: Attacker initiates SSH password brute-force attack from `198.51.100.214` targeting multiple accounts (`test`, `admin`, `root`, `oracle`, `postgres`) (`/disk/var/log/secure:155`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 00:55:55 UTC**: Attacker successfully logs in via SSH as `root` from `198.51.100.214` port 51900 (`/disk/var/log/secure:214`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 01:12:46 UTC**: Session 755 started for user `postgres` (`/disk/var/log/messages:20`). Attacker leverages PostgreSQL weak authentication (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3`) to execute arbitrary commands via `COPY ... TO PROGRAM`.
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 01:12:50 UTC**: Execution drops cryptocurrency miner / stager payload `/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon` (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/pgdaemon:1`, cited in `/sas/alerts.json:1`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 01:15:00 UTC**: DNS tunneling configuration created at `/etc/pgdaemon.conf` pointing to resolver `update-postgres.example.cn` for data exfiltration (`/disk/etc/pgdaemon.conf:3`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 01:20:00 UTC**: Cron persistence installed at `/var/spool/cron/postgres` (`/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5`, cited in `/sas/alerts.json:10`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 01:22:00 UTC**: Systemd persistence installed at `/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service` (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service:5`).
[?2004l[?2004h> - **2026-08-23 01:25:00 UTC**: Attacker executes timestomping anti-forensics on dropped files (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/.local/.timestamps:2`) and wipes credential/cache logs (`/disk/var/lib/.cache/.wiped.bin:1`).
