[?2004l[?2004h> | CHK-02 | `/var/spool/cron/postgres` | T1053.003 | Alerted (`/sas/alerts.json:10`) | Malicious cron scheduled beacon (`/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5`) |
[?2004l[?2004h> | CHK-03 | `/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service` | T1543.002 | Silent | Malicious systemd unit re-dropper (`/disk/etc/systemd/system/pg-metrics.service:5`) |
