[?2004l[?2004h> | CHK-06 | `/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf` | T1078 | Alerted (`/sas/alerts.json:18`) | Insecure database trust auth configuration (`/disk/var/lib/pgsql/data/pg_hba.conf:3`) |
