[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Expected Result: Malicious beacon command is absent (`/disk/var/spool/cron/postgres:5`).*
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 3. **Verify Systemd Service Status**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
