[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Expected Result: Unit pg-metrics.service could not be found.*
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 4. **Verify PostgreSQL Authentication Rules**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
