[?2004l[?2004h>    ```
[?2004l[?2004h>    *Expected Result: Connection rejected due to password requirement (`scram-sha-256`).*
[?2004l[?2004h> 
[?2004l[?2004h> 5. **Verify Firewall Inbound Drop Rules**:
[?2004l[?2004h>    ```bash
